
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.SetAngularVelocity(AngVel: vector, Local: boolean)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSetAngularVelocity(vector AngVel, integer Local);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Applies rotational velocity to object.
It does the same job as <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlApplyRotationalImpulse" target="_blank">llApplyRotationalImpulse</a> but doesn&#39;t depend of the mass of object .</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>vector</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>vector</span></td>
          <td>AngVel / initial_omega</td>
          <td>The angular velocity to set the object to.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Local / <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">local</a></td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a>, if <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> <b>force</b> is treated as a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Local" target="_blank">local</a> directional vector, if <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> <b>force</b> is treated as a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Region" target="_blank">region</a> directional vector</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
